cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated
  paper.
title: >-
  EX-IDA-CBM: Explainable Iron Deficiency Anemia Detection from Peripheral
  Blood Smears via Concept Bottleneck Models and Attention-Guided
  Morphological Maps
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a four-stage, inherently-interpretable deep
  learning pipeline for IDA detection from peripheral blood smears. Combines
  Cellpose-based instance segmentation, EfficientNet-B0 same-domain
  pretraining, a five-concept Concept Bottleneck Model, and multi-scale
  explainability (Grad-CAM++, Integrated Gradients, population-level
  severity grading).
